+    //
+    // Sent as a UNICAST to 127.0.0.1, not a broadcast to 127.255.255.255.
+    // macOS accepts a sendto() addressed to 127.255.255.255 — it returns the
+    // full byte count with no error — and then silently discards it: nothing
