+    // to the 127/8 broadcast address; it looks more correct and does nothing.
+    //
+    // Caveat, and the reason this is a fallback rather than an extra copy
+    // sent every tick: with SO_REUSEPORT (see the AvailableServiceList
+    // constructor) a *unicast* is delivered to exactly ONE of the sockets
+    // sharing the port, whereas a broadcast reaches all of them. So offline,
